          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TRANSFORMATION 2D\n\nThe Transformation2D node constructs the transformation2d type.\nThis type can be used to send transformation information to nodes like the Mesh2D and Camera2D nodes.\n\nThe transformation 2d type contains information about translation, scale and rotation.\nDo note that scale does not affect the Camera2D node (use zoom instead)."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
